Subject: [PATCH 25/42] ARM: shmobile: pfc: Use driver-provided pinmux info
Date: Wed, 21 Nov 2012 03:27:26 +0100
Message-Id: <1353464863-10281-26-git-send-email-laurent.pinchart+renesas@ideasonboard.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.7.8.6
In-Reply-To: <1353464863-10281-1-git-send-email-laurent.pinchart+renesas@ideasonboard.com>
